WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
Residue can remain on the wafer between layers.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
Ultrapure water rinses the surface.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
The used water is collected for treatment.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
Gases do different jobs inside the equipment.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
Other chemicals help remove material or polish a layer.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
The facility treats gases and liquids that leave the process.
